      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "witchinggadgets:tut_addon_witchinggadgets/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.witchinggadgets.tut_addon_witchinggadgets.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "巫师宝具是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "witchinggadgets:tut_addon_witchinggadgets/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.witchinggadgets.tut_addon_witchinggadgets.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "巫师宝具提供大量"
                },
                {
                  "text": "小玩意和装备",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "：用纺车织出魔法布料，做成各式斗篷和奇术口袋；饰品、宝石雕琢、炼狱高炉、群系转化器和新附魔。终局是用元始珍珠制作的元始武器和护甲。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "witchinggadgets:tut_addon_witchinggadgets/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "witchinggadgets:tut_addon_witchinggadgets/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.witchinggadgets.tut_addon_witchinggadgets.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "witchinggadgets:tut_addon_witchinggadgets/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.witchinggadgets.tut_addon_witchinggadgets.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:SPINNINGWHEEL"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：纺织工艺，无需前置。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:CLOAK"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：斗篷。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:BAGOFTRICKS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：奇术口袋。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:WGBAUBLES"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：巫师装备。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:INFERNALBLASTFURNACE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：炼狱高炉。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "witchinggadgets:PRIMORDIALGEARSET"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：元始启示录，需要虚空金属与元始珍珠。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
